To place from spot (a whole number).
The pick is spot.
Seek from spot plus 1 with pick.
If picked is not spot, swap item spot of deadlines and item picked of deadlines, swap item spot of durations and item picked of durations.

To record.
If taken is more than best, set best to taken.

To explore from spot (a whole number) with total (a whole number).
If spot is more than last, record, return.
Explore from spot plus 1 with total.
The finish is total plus item spot of durations.
If finish is at most item spot of deadlines.
Place spot into route.
Add 1 to taken.
Explore from spot plus 1 with finish.
Subtract 1 from taken.
Remove the last item from route.

For every spot from 0 to last minus 1.
